<data><item><post_title>Evertec: ANDA&#x2019;s technological partner</post_title><ID>25264</ID><post_content>&amp;nbsp;
&amp;nbsp;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.anda.com.uy/index_1.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;The National Affiliate Association,&lt;/a&gt; Anda (Asociaci&#xF3;n Nacional de Afiliados in Spanish), founded in 1933, with more than 270,000 partners through which it benefits more than 600,000 Uruguayans, in 2019 began the process to renew and update its payment platform. The objective of this modernization was to offer its associates a better service with regards to payment methods in addition to the possibilities of using these different methods in their affiliated merchants. For this, they trusted the Evertec Uruguay team to be their technological and business partner.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://localhost/evertec" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Evertec&lt;/a&gt; has had a presence in Uruguay since 2017, after the acquisition of PayTrue solutions founded in 2003 to meet the growing demand and the need for better payment systems locally and on a regional level. &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;"We found in Evertec the solution and technology we were looking for to make undergo the transformation that allowed us to maintain our renowned service, while offering a more modern and robust platform that would permit us to be more flexible, grow and face the new challenges that were arising in the world of payments",&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt; said Germ&#xE1;n L&#xF3;pez, Director of Informatics of Anda.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The project provided for a total update of ANDA&#x2019;s issuer and acquirer platform where the service was at the center of the change, providing scalability for the business, and the possibility of offering new products to its affiliates. In the third quarter of 2020, one of the first proposed milestones was reached; the release of the acquirer platform, aimed at improving the service and merchant acquirer access to ANDA.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;For its part, Yaninna Mella, General Manager of &lt;a href="https://www.anda.com.uy/index_1.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;ANDA,&lt;/a&gt; stressed that &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;"the process, collaboration, and service that Evertec offered, was the key in deciding to work with them, in addition to the flexibility and possibilities offered by its platform. We are very satisfied with the evolution of the project and excited with the upcoming changes, as always thinking about offering the best solutions to our partners. "&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;		
												&lt;img width="800" height="139" src="/evertec/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Daniel-BrigENG-2.png" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="/evertec/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Daniel-BrigENG-2.png 1000w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Daniel-BrigENG-2-300x52.png 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Daniel-BrigENG-2-768x134.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /&gt;														
		&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;ANDA&#x2019;s new payment platform will be oriented to services. &lt;em&gt;"For Evertec it is a source of pride to support and be key actors in this transformation process that ANDA has begun. We are very honored for being &#xA0;chosen as their partner to be part of this process that will surely bring benefits to many people in Uruguay, in addition to accelerating the &#xA0;the institution&#x2019;s growth in the country",&lt;/em&gt; said Daniel Brignardello, VP Payment Processing and Fraud Prevention Services at Evertec.&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2021-05-04 11:38:18</post_date><post_name>evertec-andas-technological-partner</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://wp-evtc-prd.azurewebsites.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Evertec-socio-tecnologico-de-ANDA.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>Evertec,Evertec</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>Evertec: el socio tecnol&#xF3;gico de ANDA</translated_post_title><title>Evertec: ANDA&#x2019;s technological partner</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec expands its presence in Brazil in partnership with Alelo</post_title><ID>27584</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;SAN JUAN, PUERTO RICO&#x2013; Evertec, Inc., leader in payment transactions processing services in Latin America and specialized in monitoring and fraud management, announced today its agreement with &lt;a style="color: #ff6c0c;" href="https://www.alelo.com.br/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Alelo&lt;/a&gt;, a brand specialized in benefits, incentives, and corporate expenditure management, which acts as a member Business and businesses, offering a better experience to cardholders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2003, &lt;a style="color: #ff6c0c;" href="https://www.alelo.com.br/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Alelo&lt;/a&gt; has more than fifteen years of experience in the market, and since 2013, it has been a leader in the benefit sector through &lt;strong&gt;the Workers&#x2019; Food Program&lt;/strong&gt; (PAT) of the Ministry of Labor (MPT). It has more than 130,000 customer-centric companies, 8 million users, and more than 600 thousand affiliated businesses in Brazil.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mac Schuessler, president and CEO of Evertec, indicated&lt;/strong&gt;: &#x201C;We are pleased with the trust placed by &lt;a style="color: #ff6c0c;" href="https://www.alelo.com.br/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Alelo&lt;/a&gt; in Evertec. This agreement is significant due to the important role that &lt;a style="color: #ff6c0c;" href="https://www.alelo.com.br/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Alelo&lt;/a&gt; has in the Brazilian market. In 2018, &lt;a style="color: #ff6c0c;" href="https://www.alelo.com.br/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Alelo&lt;/a&gt; processed over 600 million transactions only in its workers&#x2019; program. This is a great testimony of the continuous adoption of our technology throughout Latin America.&#x201D;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adriano Tchen, Alelo&#x2019;s CIO, stressed that &#x201C;Choosing Evertec as a technological partner is the result of a profound analysis of the market, as well as the trust the company has earned during its time in Brazil. Evertec offers us a flexible and modular solution that will allow us to streamline the response times to our customers and, therefore, provide them with a better service.&#x201C;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2020-05-26 04:14:32</post_date><post_name>evertec-expands-its-presence-in-brazil-in-partnership-with-alelo</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://wp-evtc-prd.azurewebsites.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/banner-Evertec-expande-su-presencia-en-Brasil-en-alianza-con-Alelo-evertec.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>closed</comment_status><ping_status>closed</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count>4</ekit_post_views_count><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>Evertec expande su presencia en Brasil en alianza con Alelo</translated_post_title><title>Evertec expands its presence in Brazil in partnership with Alelo</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Acumatica: Flexible Cutting-Edge Tools</post_title><ID>38364</ID><post_content>&lt;h4&gt;History of Cantera Carraizo&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Cantera Carraizo, Inc. is a company dedicated to the extraction and processing of materials from the earth's crust to convert them into construction aggregates, such as gravel, stone, and filler. It was founded 38 years ago on March 30, 1984, in the Carraizo neighborhood, in Trujillo Alto, Puerto Rico. The company, led by Engineer Alfonso M. Diaz, employs 38 people and provides services to the entire island.&#xD;
&lt;h4&gt;The challenge&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Our relationship with Evertec began in mid-2021 as we looked for a company with experience in application integrations. We needed an interface that would integrate the truck scale software we were using with our accounting application. We tried several times to integrate the applications on our own with no success. We urgently needed to streamline the invoicing process, which was, at the time, taking us a total of 5 hours per day to complete. The process we had implemented, due to lack of integration, required 2 hours to validate and classify the product receipts and 3 additional hours of manual data entry.&#xD;
&#xD;
At Cantera Carraizo, we use an AWSys (Advanced Weighing System) truck scale software that did not integrate with our existing Sage 50 (Peachtree) accounting system. This forced us to enter the data manually in both systems in order to generate invoices, which made the process very slow and susceptible to data-entry errors. We have an island-wide operation, so we urgently needed these systems to connect.&#xD;
&#xD;
Cantera Carraizo needed an interface that integrated the truck scale software with the accounting application.&#xD;
&lt;h4&gt;The solution&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
After evaluating the systems we were using and our business needs, Evertec determined that Sage 50 did not have the ability to integrate with the truck scale software. They recommended switching to the Acumatica ERP system, which was easy to use and would give us the flexibility we needed to integrate the AWSys system. Acumatica would also allow us to optimize other operational processes, which would reduce the lead times in other areas.&#xD;
&#xD;
With Acumatica ERP, we were not only able to integrate the scale software with the new accounting system, but we also managed to cut back the billing process to less than 1 hour per day. Now, we only need to spend some time conducting a simple data review as part of our regular billing protocol. Acumatica makes all our work easier by automatically extracting the data from the AWSys and making it accessible through the platform in a fast and accurate way. The platform is easy to use, so we adapted to the new system quickly, thus allowing us to benefit from the platform almost immediately.&#xD;
&#xD;
With Acumatica, we have also automated processes that we used to perform manually, such as creating reports like the Profit &amp;amp; Loss, which Acumatica now generates automatically at the beginning of each week.&#xD;
&#xD;
Cantera Carraizo started implementing Acumatica on July 1, 2021, and completed the process with support from the Evertec team in just one and a half months, on August 16, 2021.&#xD;
&#xD;
At Cantera Carraizo, we know that the expertise of Evertec's team with Acumatica and other ERP systems integrations, along with their understanding of our business operations, allowed us to implement the platform successfully and quickly. Another factor that helped was Acumatica's flexible and innovative tools, which helped us make the implementation process faster and more streamlined so we could have a fully integrated system in a very short period of time.&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;em&gt;"We are very happy with how the Acumatica system has been implemented and with the support from Evertec's team. We have managed to reduce the lead times of key processes in our operations and have automated tasks to allow us to provide a better and faster service for our customers. Everyone in the company is very excited about this transformation in our operations."&lt;/em&gt; - Engineer Alfonso M. Diaz, President of Cantera Carraizo, Inc.&#xD;
&lt;h4&gt;Results&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
The company is very excited about the changes brought by Acumatica into the company's operation. By reducing the time spent on billing and reporting processes by 50%, we can now focus on other key operational processes. And with a unified system like the one we have now, we have a more comprehensive and up-to-date picture of the entire organization, which will help us grow even more in the industry.&#xD;
&#xD;
In addition to the vertical integration of the scale software and the reduced processing times, Acumatica has made it easy to expand our business operations to support new acquisitions thanks to the multi-entity support provided by the platform and its unique structure with unlimited users. This system feature has eliminated the cost per additional license that the acquisition would have entailed, allowing us to save during the expansion process.&#xD;
&#xD;
For more information about Acumatica: &lt;a style="color: #f36e21;" href="http://localhost/evertec/acumatica-erp/"&gt;http://localhost/evertec/acumatica-erp/&lt;/a&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2022-07-11 18:30:37</post_date><post_name>acumatica-flexible-cutting-edge-tools</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2022/07/cantera-carraizo-acumatica-herraminetas-flexibles-de-vanguardia.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>Acumatica, herramientas flexibles y de vanguardia</translated_post_title><title>Acumatica: Flexible Cutting-Edge Tools</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Smart Fit, Improving the recurring payment processes</post_title><ID>39145</ID><post_content>&lt;h4&gt;Challenges&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Smart Fit had really interesting challenges in 2015 because they were opening new branches needed to offer secure, effective and easy ways and channels to interact with their users and receive payments.&#xD;
&lt;h4&gt;The solution&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
With &lt;a style="color: #f36e00;" href="/en/ecommerce-gateway/"&gt;Placetopay&lt;/a&gt;, Evertec&#x2019;s online digital payment platform, SmartFit found the perfect solution to address their needs. Through their WebCheckout functionality, all user payments, either with credit cards or PSE (&#x201C;&lt;em&gt;Pagos seguros en l&#xED;nea&lt;/em&gt;&#x201D; in Spanish, online secure payments), could be processed, improving the recurring payment processes as well boosting their operational efficiency. The response was excellent, and the payment processing volume has grown steadily, reaching monthly peaks of more than 140,000 transactions. This milestone was the result of the joint work between both companies, transforming an infrastructure or platform challenge into an opportunity to improve the user experience through a simple, friendly and very secure transactional process experience. Since then, the relationship of trust and collaboration between both companies has generated more business opportunities and allowed us to constantly work together on new projects.&#xD;
&#xD;
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2KtbfYeJGRY&#xD;
&lt;h4&gt;Benefits&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Smart Fit managed to quickly and effectively integrate the digital payment solution, achieving the desired result. In &lt;a style="color: #f36e00;" href="/en/ecommerce-gateway/"&gt;Placetopay&lt;/a&gt;, they found the PCI standard security guarantee they were looking to ensure their solution offered a high level of security and the payment processed was actively monitored to safeguard their user's information.&#xD;
&#xD;
The success of the Smart Fit implementation with the &lt;a style="color: #f36e00;" href="/en/ecommerce-gateway/"&gt;Placetopay&lt;/a&gt; platform was a direct result of the constant communication with Evertec where we understood and addressed the needs, keeping conversation channels open for both parties, to ensure that everything went efficiently and effectively.&#xD;
&#xD;
According to Smart Fit&#xB4;s experience, one of the main reasons for choosing Evertec is that the company focuses on the user&#x2019;s transaction experience making it efficient, secure and easy to perform, therefore, offering the business the peace of mind needed to focus on its expansion and growth always offering their consumers the best user experience.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;There are many gateways in the digital space, however, it would be great if you gave your company the opportunity to learn about Evertec's Placetopay solution. When we, at Smart Fit, started working with Evertec, we did some very interesting work and, I am sure that they will also be able to adapt to address the needs that you might have in your organization.&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;footer&gt;&lt;cite&gt;Juan Carlos Lozano, Smart Fit Technology Manager&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Smart Fit is the largest sports academy network outside the United States, and a leader in this segment in Latin America. Founded in Sao Paulo in 2009, they started operations in Colombia in 2015. Is the low-cost, high-value chain from Smart Fit Group, which also includes Bio Ritmo gyms network.</post_excerpt><post_date>2022-09-30 09:17:54</post_date><post_name>smart-fit-improving-the-recurring-payment-processes</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2022/09/SmartFit-mejorando-proceso-pago.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Opcional,Opcional,</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>Smart Fit, mejorando el proceso de pago de sus clientes</translated_post_title><title>Smart Fit, Improving the recurring payment processes</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Department of Antioquia</post_title><ID>40911</ID><post_content>Citizens are the main focus, which is why strategies have been implemented to ensure that they receive assistance that meets their needs in a timely manner. These strategies also ensure that the community will have access to the entity&#x2019;s services, providing its users with top-notch benefits.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The challenge&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Looking to improve the quality of the services provided to its citizens, the Antioquia Government has worked hard to obtain tools that offer its citizens more channels to pay their taxes online in a secure manner and protect their confidential information to prevent any potential fraud when conducting this process.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The solution&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
With the Evertec PlacetoPay gateway, the Antioquia Government was able to implement a payment button, allowing taxpayers to complete their transactions and pay their taxes online without having to visit the offices. This implementation initially focused on one type of transaction: vehicle taxes, which represent the highest source of revenue for the department to date. Over the years, the feature was used often, and was upgraded to include other services, such as self-disclosures and electronic signatures. This adoption was achieved thanks to the awareness raised and the culture created around online payments and transactions.&#xD;
&#xD;
This is how the alliance with Evertec has been integral to the organization's digital transformation process, resulting in a synergy that has led to exclusive developments not yet available in through other gateways in Colombia.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&#x201C;The Antioquia Government has always had a latent need to expand the channels to provide better services to its citizens. Evertec listened to our need and assisted us. This joint effort with other banking entities has allowed us to put together an excellent working team, which is evident when you look at the level of satisfaction among our citizens.&#x201D;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Ivon Stella Gonz&#xE1;lez&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The results&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
During these 10 years of hard work, the benefits have been significant both for the people and for the Department of Antioquia, whose focus is to meet the requirements that will enable improving their taxpayers' lives.&#xD;
According to the Department, the greatest benefit has been the improvement in collections. By having more service channels, users find more options to pay their obligations. Additional sources of revenue have also been addressed, such as vehicle taxes, gasoline surcharge taxes, and passports, among others. This has allowed them to reach different sectors of the population by using the proceeds to do more social work.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Conclusions&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li style="list-style-type: none;"&gt;&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Transaction security plays an important role when it comes in providing taxpayers with more options to make payments to the department.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
&amp;nbsp;&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li style="list-style-type: none;"&gt;&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Awareness has been raised to help taxpayers overcome their fears and skepticism regarding online payments, helping them understand that having more options benefits both the users and the organization.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
&amp;nbsp;&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li style="list-style-type: none;"&gt;&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;The Antioquia Government strives to continue improving their relationship with their technological partners to obtain better results. The goal is to bring all of the Department's collections and payments to digital channels, offering taxpayers not only a physical payment method but also the convenience of being able to pay from wherever they are.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
&amp;nbsp;&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;The entity's digital transformation has helped reduce its internal operational burden and costs, which is reflected outwardly in the form of better service delivery and increase in user satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>The Departmental Government of Antioquia is a public entity that handles matters related to the  planning and promotion of the department's economic, political, and social development. It currently employs more than 3,000 people, including employees and contractors, whose primary objective is to improve the social well-being of the people of Antioquia.</post_excerpt><post_date>2023-02-14 13:34:27</post_date><post_name>department-of-antioquia</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Departamento-de-Antioquia.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>Departamento de Antioquia</translated_post_title><title>Department of Antioquia</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Moving Forward and Growing Together</post_title><ID>41484</ID><post_content>&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a style="color: #f36e21;" href="https://www.presente.com.co/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Presente&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, the employee fund at Grupo &#xC9;xito, is a socially responsible entity that provides savings, credit, recreation and social security services. It currently offers a private multi-segment card (managed by Evertec) for its more than 37 thousand associates. Until now, this card only allowed transactions at Presente network ATMs and/or at the pin pads of &#xC9;xito department merchants.&#xD;
&#xD;
In an effort to provide greater added value to its associates in terms of coverage, simplicity, and availability, &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a style="color: #f36e21;" href="https://www.presente.com.co/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Presente&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; in partnership with Evertec, developed a project to facilitate additional options to use the card in nationwide networks. This new feature allows the cardholder to make purchases at authorized merchants participating in the employee fund's agreement.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;"By implementing this new system, we once again ratify our commitment to evolution, development and digitization in order to provide more benefits to our client's associates,"&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Sandra Romero,&#xD;
Country Manager at Evertec Colombia.&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
This partnership brings a winning team that strives for further growth, while promoting benefits for Presente and its affiliates, consolidating projects and making them a reality.&#xD;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We congratulate Presente on this new achievement and may it mark the beginning of a new era of growth and transformation!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2023-03-30 18:20:52</post_date><post_name>moving-forward-and-growing-together</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Presente-avanzamos-impulsamos-para-crecer.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>Avanzamos juntos y nos impulsamos para crecer</translated_post_title><title>Moving Forward and Growing Together</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>History of Laboratorio Cl&#xED;nico Toledo</post_title><ID>52554</ID><post_content>&lt;h2&gt;The Challenge&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;In the complex digital world, saturated with cyber threats, it is crucial to remain vigilant against vulnerabilities, even when we believe we are secure. At Laboratorio Cl&#xED;nico Toledo, we faced the crucial challenge of strengthening the security of our IT infrastructure, especially during nighttime hours. That's when we partnered with Evertec, experts in the field, to implement essential solutions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;The Solution&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hand in hand with Evertec, we established a 24/7 monitoring system and an immutable external backup system in an external data center. This solution stood out for its ability to record all events, providing greater reliability in our backups and ensuring the security of our transactions. The benefits of the solution are evident: improved control of our IT assets and a significant reduction in risks. We conduct regular vulnerability scans and work with the Evertec team to assess and address identified vulnerabilities, significantly strengthening our cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Results&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thanks to the implementation of Evertec's solutions, we have achieved greater visibility of our IT infrastructure, including servers and firewalls, significantly enhancing efficiency and security throughout the company. Now, whenever a server is created, modified, or logged into, we receive a notification to validate the action. This constant vigilance has provided us with peace of mind, knowing that we are being monitored 24 hours a day, significantly reducing the risk associated with cyber attacks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This strategic collaboration with Evertec has transformed our approach to cybersecurity, ensuring safer and more efficient operations for both our staff and clients. We are grateful for the commitment of the Evertec team, which was key to the success of this implementation. Now, our digital assets are safer than ever, allowing us to focus on providing quality services to our clients with complete confidence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To learn more about our cybersecurity services, please visit &lt;a style="color: #ff6c0c;" href="/en/cybersecurity/"&gt;www.evertecinc.com/en/cybersecurity/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Laboratorio Cl&#xED;nico Toledo is a leader in the healthcare sector in Puerto Rico and the Caribbean. With over 35 years of experience, it is the largest reference laboratory in the region, with the capacity to process up to 98.5% of the tests received. It has a staff of more than 290 employees, 6 branches, and 5 subsidiaries, serving over 1,000 clients.</post_excerpt><post_date>2023-10-19 14:44:09</post_date><post_name>history-of-laboratorio-clinico-toledo</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/laboratorio-clinico-toledo.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>Evertec,IT infrastructure,laboratorio toledo</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>Historia de Laboratorio Cl&#xED;nico Toledo</translated_post_title><title>History of Laboratorio Cl&#xED;nico Toledo</title><meta_desc>At Laboratorio Cl&#xED;nico Toledo, we faced the crucial challenge of strengthening the security of our IT infrastructure, especially during nighttime hours.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Laboratorio Cl&#xED;nico Toledo</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Fasttrack &amp; Evertec, a partnership with full security</post_title><ID>52668</ID><post_content>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#x201C;We are confident that the implementation of Evertec's &lt;a style="color: #ff6c0c;" href="/en/ecommerce-gateway/"&gt;Scudo API&lt;/a&gt;tool will effectively prevent and detect any suspicious activity, thus strengthening the trust of Fasttrack's customers. We understand that security is a fundamental priority, and this action reflects our determination to stay at the forefront and strike the right balance between chargeback risk, approval rates, and validation costs,"&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Ricardo Pinillos, Gerente de Producto e Innovaci&#xF3;n Evertec Placetopay. &lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
Security is our top priority, which is why we have a comprehensive system that enhances and supports one of &lt;a style="color: #ff6c0c;" href="https://www.fasttrack.com.co/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Fasttrack's&lt;/a&gt; most important pillars: dedicating significant effort to protecting itself and its customers against fraudulent attacks. Thank you for the trust placed in Evertec; we continue to contribute and work for the well-being of our customers&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;strong&gt;&#xA1;Congratulations to Fasttrack for taking this important step and for your commitment to security!&lt;/strong&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Fasttrack is a Colombian company with over 10 years in the market, offering transactional payment and collection solutions tailored to the requirements and needs of its clients, enabling safer, more reliable, and profitable business transactions.</post_excerpt><post_date>2023-10-23 15:20:41</post_date><post_name>fasttrack-evertec-partnership-with-full-security</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Fasttrack-evertec-alianza.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>API,Evertec,Fast track colombia,Placetopay,Scudo,seguridad</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>Fasttrack &amp;#038; Evertec, una alianza con toda seguridad</translated_post_title><title>Fasttrack &amp; Evertec, a partnership with full security</title><meta_desc>We have a comprehensive system that enhances and supports one of Fasttrack's most important pillars</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Alianza entre Fasttrack &amp; Evertec</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Revolutionizing banking: Evertec transforms Banco Cooperativo with cloud-native online banking</post_title><ID>56875</ID><post_content>&lt;h2&gt;Technological Prowess: A Hybrid Solution Powered by AWS&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Evertec's solution is a testament to the power of cutting-edge technology, leveraging the capabilities of Amazon Web Services (AWS) to deliver a hybrid solution. By combining the strengths of cloud-native architecture with on-premises infrastructure, Evertec ensures a robust and flexible platform for Banco Cooperativo.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Cloud-Native Excellence with AWS Serverless Platforms&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;At the core of this transformation is Evertec's commitment to cloud-native solutions, manifested through the utilization of AWS serverless platforms. The implementation showcases Evertec's proficiency in designing scalable and efficient systems that utilize AWS services such as DynamoDB, Lambda, Cognito, S3, AWS API Gateway, Fargate, CloudFront, and CloudWatch.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Seamless Implementation with AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;This forward-thinking approach is further exemplified by the use of the AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK). This enabled a comprehensive Infrastructure as Code (IaC) definition, allowing for the swift and precise provisioning of the entire platform within AWS. The result is an online banking system that is not only robust but also easily adaptable to evolving needs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Ensuring Security and Compliance: A PCI-Compliant Solution&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Recognizing the paramount importance of security in the financial sector, this solution is PCI-compliant ensuring that sensitive financial information is handled with the utmost care and aligns with industry standards, providing Banco Cooperativo a solution with the highest security standards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Leveraging Evertec&#x2019;s Core Network Architecture for Enhanced Security&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Evertec goes above and beyond by integrating its core network architecture in AWS to bolster external networking and security measures for Banco Cooperativo. This holistic approach ensures that the online banking system is not only user-friendly but also fortified against potential cyber threats.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Transformative Impact: DynamoDB, Lambda, and More&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Evertec's solution harnesses the power of various AWS services to deliver a seamless and responsive online banking experience. DynamoDB ensures efficient data storage, Lambda facilitates serverless computing for dynamic tasks, and services like Cognito enhance user authentication. The use of S3, AWS API Gateway, Fargate, CloudFront, and CloudWatch collectively contributes to an ecosystem that is both high-performing and resilient.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Customer-Centric Approach: Elevating User Experience&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Through this collaboration, Evertec has not only delivered an innovative technological solution but has also prioritized the end-user experience. The online banking system is designed to be intuitive and user-friendly, ensuring that Banco Cooperativo's customers can navigate their financial transactions with ease.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The successful implementation of an online banking front-end system for Banco Cooperativo stands as a shining example of technological innovation and customer-centric solutions. This collaboration not only transforms the banking experience for Banco Cooperativo but also positions Evertec as a trailblazer in delivering cutting-edge solutions that bridge the gap between traditional and modern banking.&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>In a groundbreaking collaboration, Evertec has successfully spearheaded the design, development, and implementation of an advanced online banking front-end system for Banco Cooperativo of Puerto Rico. This achievement not only modernizes Banco Cooperativo's banking experience but also demonstrates Evertec's expertise in creating innovative solutions that seamlessly integrate with existing on-premises core banking systems.</post_excerpt><post_date>2023-12-20 12:42:39</post_date><post_name>revolutionizing-banking</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Bancoop-cloud-native.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>API,AWS,Banco Cooperativo,DynamoDB,Evertec,online banking,PCI,seguridad,Serverless</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>Revolucionando soluciones financieras: Evertec transforma los procesos de Banco Cooperativo con banca en l&#xED;nea nativa de la nube</translated_post_title><title>Revolutionizing banking: Evertec transforms Banco Cooperativo with cloud-native online banking</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Safeguarding transactions: Evertec's real-time fraud detection revolutionizes ATH M&#xF3;vil</post_title><ID>56890</ID><post_content>&lt;h2&gt;Technological Integration: ATH M&#xF3;vil and Risk Center Unite&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Evertec's expertise shines through in the successful implementation of a real-time integration between ATH M&#xF3;vil and Risk Center, a sophisticated fraud-detection system. This integration is a pivotal step in enhancing the security framework for Red ATH Network, ensuring a proactive approach to mitigating fraud risks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Enhancing Security for Financial Institutions&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Evertec recognizes the paramount importance of security in the financial sector. Our real-time fraud detection system is designed to empower financial institutions, providing them with the tools needed to significantly lower the incidence of fraud in both person-to-person and person-to-business transactions. By doing so, we contribute to fostering a more secure and trustworthy financial ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The new architecture facilitates real-time fraud detection by seamlessly invoking a REST service. This service plays a crucial role in evaluating transactions for potential fraud, ensuring that any suspicious activity is promptly identified and addressed. The speed and accuracy of this real-time approach set a new standard for transaction security.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Utilizing Advanced AWS Services: SQS, Lambda, S3, CloudWatch&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Evertec's solution harnesses the power of several advanced AWS services to create a robust and efficient real-time fraud detection system. Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS) ensures seamless communication between components, Lambda enables serverless computing for dynamic tasks, S3 serves as a secure and scalable storage solution, and CloudWatch provides comprehensive monitoring and alerting capabilities. This strategic combination of services ensures a reliable and responsive system capable of meeting the demanding requirements of modern financial&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Results: A Safer Financial Ecosystem&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Through our collaboration with ATH M&#xF3;vil and Red ATH Network, Evertec has successfully transformed the landscape of transaction security. The implementation of real-time fraud detection has not only elevated the level of protection for financial institutions but has also instilled confidence among users engaging in person-to-person and person-to-business transactions. The system's efficacy in identifying and mitigating fraud in real-time has resulted in a safer financial ecosystem for all stakeholders involved.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Evertec's implementation of a real-time fraud detection system for ATH M&#xF3;vil exemplifies our commitment to pushing the boundaries of technological innovation in the financial sector. This success story is not just about securing transactions; it's about empowering financial institutions with the tools they need to navigate the digital landscape confidently and securely.&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>At Evertec, we are thrilled to share a remarkable success story that highlights our dedication to innovation and security in the realm of financial transactions. Our latest achievement involves the implementation of a cutting-edge real-time fraud detection system for ATH M&#xF3;vil, a prominent payments platform connecting Red ATH Network and merchants. This transformative solution not only fortifies the security landscape but also underscores Evertec's commitment to helping financial institutions reduce fraud in person-to-person and person-to-business transactions.</post_excerpt><post_date>2023-12-20 13:13:23</post_date><post_name>safeguarding-transactions</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/prevencion-de-fraude-con-ATH-movil.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>ATH M&#xF3;vil,AWS,Evertec,PCI,seguridad</post_tag><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>Protegiendo transacciones: La detecci&#xF3;n de fraudes entiempo real de Evertec revoluciona ATH M&#xF3;vil</translated_post_title><title>%%title%% %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>We are thrilled to share a remarkable success story that highlights our dedication to innovation and security in the realm of financial transactions.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>All Tickets and Evertec: the story of how ticketing became a secure customer experience</post_title><ID>59568</ID><post_content>&lt;h2&gt;Beginnings&#xA0;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Seven years ago, Jaime Rojas, CEO and founding partner of &lt;a href="https://allticketscol.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;All Tickets&lt;/a&gt;, recognized the need in ticketing and entertainment market in Colombia. In the midst of this context, and three years after the creation of the company, he partnered with systems engineer Juan Sebastian Cabra, current CTO, to take the ticketing experience to another level. Together, they have turned All Tickets into a secure, accessible and customer-focused platform. Today they have a portfolio of more than 35 clients nationwide, bringing together a diversity of events. In the words of the partners, "we attend any event that needs ticketing: from a massive concert to the box office for an art exhibition".&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Challenges&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;All Tickets sells 98% of its products online. During the year 2023, they recorded more than 3.3 million dollars in sales and marketed more than 94,000 tickets, facing challenges in terms of payment security and data preservation, as it happens to all e-commerce in the world. In the context of this scenario, and with the company's growth figures, the need arose to find a solution and an ally to provide the necessary agility, efficiency and security in the processing of online transactions. At that moment, they found Evertec as a strategic ally. Security has become their flagship, and their commitment is to provide their customers with a first-class experience, guaranteeing the protection of their data and transactions at all times.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Solution&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Evertec, as a technological partner, offered All Tickets &lt;a href="/en/ecommerce-gateway/"&gt;Web Checkout&lt;/a&gt;, a solution that offers the possibility of integrating and accepting multiple means of payment in the digital channel, reinforced with the &lt;a href="/en/3dsecure-protocol/"&gt;3DS&lt;/a&gt; (Three Domain Security System) security protocol. With &lt;a href="/en/3dsecure-protocol/"&gt;3DS&lt;/a&gt;, the system provides additional authentication that significantly reduces the risk of fraud, as it verifies that the cardholder is the one who is actually making the purchase. In addition, by transferring the responsibility for fraud to the issuing bank, the protocol provides an additional protection tool for users. The combination of multiple payment methods, coupled with a streamlined shopping experience in the digital channel through Web Checkout and the robust &lt;a href="/en/3dsecure-protocol/"&gt;3DS&lt;/a&gt; security system, places All Tickets and Evertec at the forefront of efficiency, security and reliability in ticketing transaction processing. This proactive and robust approach ensures greater efficiency and security for customers during their purchasing process.&lt;/p&gt;		
					&lt;blockquote&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;
				"We are excited to share that All Tickets has a new ally for a more efficient and secure operation. For us, it is fundamental to ensure that every day our customers have a first-class ticketing experience"			&lt;/p&gt;
											&lt;cite&gt;Jaime Rojas, &lt;br&gt;CEO of All Tickets.&lt;/cite&gt;
					&lt;/blockquote&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>All Tickets is a Colombian company specialized in the sale and management of event tickets (or ticketing). Founded seven years ago by a young entrepreneur, this project continues to innovate and work towards revolutionizing the ticketing industry. Its goal is to improve the user experience by facilitating the purchase of tickets for all types of events, from anywhere, at any time, quickly and securely. </post_excerpt><post_date>2024-07-12 14:46:09</post_date><post_name>all-tickets-and-evertec-the-story-of-how-ticketing-became-a-secure-customer-experience</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/all-tickets-y-evertec.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>3DS,All Tickets,Evertec Colombia,ticketing,web checkout</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>All Tickets y Evertec: la historia de c&#xF3;mo el ticketing se convirti&#xF3; en una experiencia al cliente segura</translated_post_title><title>All Tickets and Evertec: the story of how ticketing became a secure customer experience</title><meta_desc>Evertec ofreci&#xF3; a All Tickets el Web Checkout, una soluci&#xF3;n que brinda la posibilidad de integrar y aceptar m&#xFA;ltiples medios de pago.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Evertec ofreci&#xF3; a All Tickets el Web Checkout</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Q10 and Evertec: partners driving education worldwide</post_title><ID>60322</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;On this occasion, we traveled to Colombia to meet &lt;a href="https://www.q10.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Q10&lt;/a&gt;, a company that promotes the organizational development of institutions and companies through technological solutions. &lt;a href="https://www.q10.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Q10&lt;/a&gt; shares with us the impact of its alliance with Evertec, a collaboration that has strengthened its management system and technological services, including electronic invoicing in the cloud. This alliance has allowed &lt;a href="https://www.q10.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Q10&lt;/a&gt; to expand its reach to more than three thousand clients worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Integration process&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;According to company members, the collaboration process with Evertec has been robust and effective. Evertec has demonstrated the ability to adapt to Q10's business priorities, in addition to offering valuable consulting in user experience, process optimization and delivery time reduction.&lt;/p&gt;		
					&lt;blockquote&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;
				&#x201C;It has been a partnership that has been evolving since we started the alliance with Evertec,&#x201D; said an account executive involved in the project, who values Evertec's efforts to facilitate the business' operational processes.			&lt;/p&gt;
					&lt;/blockquote&gt;
		&lt;h2&gt;Results&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since the integration to Evertec's partner program, Q10 has been able to connect with 150 clients from the administrative and educational management platform in the cloud.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Benefits: &lt;br /&gt;support, immediacy and service&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#x201C;The main benefits that we have at this moment with the incorporation would be the integral service that we handle from the technical part, from the consulting issue, in case it is required, there is any doubt, or it is required as some support&#x201D; assures the professional in charge of the accompaniment of the project, who also points out the importance of aspects such as the immediacy in the attention of punctual needs. For example, in the processing of payments and others inherent to the operation of the multinational.&lt;br /&gt;It also highlights a comprehensive approach as far as service is concerned since, &#x201C;not only covers the technical part, but as soon personalized advice that we have been provided also by the options that handle the variety, as updates in the market&#x201D;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why join the &lt;br /&gt;Evertec Partner Program?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Agility, speed, automation and growth are just some of the pillars and reasons why our business partners recommend Evertec.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#x201C;From Q10 we would like to invite you to join Evertec's partner program because of all the integrality it manages, which allows us to create much stronger and closer relationships with our clients. Because it provides too much automation, processes are lightened, and allow for greater detail of all the transactional issues that are handled, so it is quite nice and I recommend it,&#x201D; she concludes with conviction.&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>At Evertec, we pride ourselves on being that key partner that drives the reach and growth of organizations. Our culture of constant innovation based on more than 20 years of experience allows us to offer a wide range of solutions for payment processing, risk management, business continuity and much more.</post_excerpt><post_date>2024-07-29 14:48:36</post_date><post_name>q10-and-evertec-partners-driving-education-worldwide</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Q10-y-evertec-aliados-educacion.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>educaci&#xF3;n,Evertec,Evertec Colombia,procesamiento de pagos,Q10</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>Q10 y Evertec: aliados que impulsan la educaci&#xF3;n a nivel mundial</translated_post_title><title>Q10 and Evertec: partners driving education worldwide</title><meta_desc>Nuestra cultura de innovaci&#xF3;n nos permite ofrecer soluciones de procesamiento de pagos, administraci&#xF3;n de riesgos, continuidad de negocios...</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Q10 y Evertec: aliados que impulsan la educaci&#xF3;n a nivel mundial</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>La Tiquetera: Transforming the online shopping experience with technology and innovation</post_title><ID>62557</ID><post_content>Colombian company leader in the sale of tickets for events. Founded in Medell&#xED;n in 2014, it offers an online platform and physical points of sale for users to purchase tickets for shows and events easily and securely.&#xD;
&#xD;
With a customer-centric approach, &lt;a href="https://latiquetera.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;La Tiquetera&lt;/a&gt; stands out for its state-of-the-art technology, high security standards and quality service that meets the needs of both entrepreneurs and buyers.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The challenge&#xD;
&lt;strong&gt;a payment solution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
La Tiquetera, a Colombian company pioneer in the online sale of event tickets, was looking for a payment solution that would allow them to:&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide a secure and reliable shopping experience&lt;/strong&gt;: For La Tiquetera, transaction security was a top priority for its users.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offer a user-friendly and intuitive interface&lt;/strong&gt;: To facilitate the purchase of tickets on their website and from any device.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure online transaction processing&lt;/strong&gt;: Guaranteeing the immediate availability of purchased tickets.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The solution&#xD;
&lt;strong&gt;the positive results&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Evertec, with its extensive experience in the market, became the perfect partner for La Tiquetera. Through its online payment platform solutions, Placetopay, it offered its Web Checkout and Payment Link natively integrated with its security solutions: Scudo and 3DS. With this it achieved:&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize the user experience&lt;/strong&gt;: by integrating a friendly and responsive interface into Web Checkout, which facilitates the purchase of tickets from any device.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offer greater flexibility and efficiency&lt;/strong&gt;: adopting Link de Pagos allowed La Tiquetera to generate customized links for different events and promotions, increasing efficiency and payment options for its customers.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen security&lt;/strong&gt;: through the 3DS protocol and the Scudo anti-fraud solution, they provided an additional layer of protection against online fraud.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
The implementation of Evertec's solutions generated positive results for La Tiquetera:&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Significant reduction in online fraud.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Business growth and increased sales.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Increased efficiency in payment processes.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;More agile and satisfactory shopping experience for users.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Lessons &lt;strong&gt;learned&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;The importance of having a comprehensive payment provider that offers customized solutions tailored to the specific needs of each business.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;The need to prioritize security and fraud prevention to ensure customer confidence and business growth.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;The success of the partnership lies in the good attention from Evertec Placetopay and the proper documentation that was shared with us. It has been a joint work that has allowed us to grow and improve processes in order to meet the expectations and needs of all the actors that are part of our ecosystem&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Susana Feria,&#xD;
Manager and Legal Representative&#xD;
La Tiquetera&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2024-12-27 10:07:30</post_date><post_name>la-tiquetera-transforming-the-online-shopping</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/LaTiquetera.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>Evertec Colombia,La Tiquetera,link de pagos,Placetopay,web checkout</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>La Tiquetera: Transformando la experiencia de compra online con tecnolog&#xED;a e innovaci&#xF3;n</translated_post_title><title>La Tiquetera: Transforming the online shopping experience with technology and innovation</title><meta_desc>Evertec became the perfect ally for La Tiquetera with the solutions of its online payment platform, Placetopay.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Evertec became the perfect ally for La Tiquetera</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Banco de Costa Rica and Evertec: Driving Innovation in Payment Solutions</post_title><ID>62643</ID><post_content>&lt;h2&gt;The Challenge:&#xD;
Thriving in a Highly Competitive Market competitivo&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
In the payments sector, particularly in payment acquisition, the market is often saturated with technological options, making innovation essential for staying ahead. With a strong foundation in traditional banking, BCR aimed to provide agile, secure, and technologically advanced solutions to meet the demands of a dynamic market where consumers expect faster, easier, and safer services.&#xD;
&#xD;
Businesses, especially small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs), required tools to efficiently and securely accept electronic payments. However, they often faced challenges due to inadequate infrastructure and the perception that adopting new technologies could be costly and complex.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The Solution:&#xD;
Technological Innovation and Strategic Collaboration&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
To meet market demands, &lt;a href="https://www.bancobcr.com/wps/portal/bcr" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Banco de Costa Rica&lt;/a&gt; strengthened its partnership with Evertec, a leader in payment and financial technology solutions. This transition from a vendor-client relationship to a strategic alliance was crucial in developing innovative solutions tailored to the local market and positioned BCR as a leader in the payment industry.&#xD;
&#xD;
Through this collaboration, Banco de Costa Rica introduced technologies that had previously only been accessible in more developed markets, enabling its customers to compete globally. One of the most notable innovations was the implementation of &lt;strong&gt;Tap M&#xF3;vil&lt;/strong&gt;, a solution that allows small and medium-sized businesses to accept electronic payments using only mobile phones. This eliminates the need for expensive traditional point-of-sale terminals. This technology empowered entrepreneurs, including artisans and small business owners, by providing secure, efficient, and user-friendly payment solutions, opening doors to new customers and markets, including international ones.&#xD;
&#xD;
Additionally, Evertec provided advanced tools to &lt;strong&gt;enhance security and efficiency in e-commerce&lt;/strong&gt;. With new wired and wireless payment terminals, BCR could offer customized solutions for both traditional and online businesses, improving the customer experience with each transaction. Security, a critical aspect of electronic payments, was prioritized across all implemented solutions, ensuring secure transactions and reducing the risk of fraud..&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The Results:&#xD;
Growth, Innovation, and Market Expansion&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
The results of this strategic alliance have been impressive. Since its implementation, Banco de Costa Rica has established itself as an innovative leader in state banking, recognized for its ability to adopt new technologies and its commitment to providing solutions that genuinely enhance its customers' lives. The integration of tools such as e-commerce, digital wallets, and mobile payment solutions has transformed how the bank&#x2019;s customers conduct business.&#xD;
&#xD;
One of the most significant impacts has been on small artisans who previously only accepted cash payments. With the introduction of electronic payment solutions, these small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) have expanded their markets, reached international clients, and increased their sales. This technology has enabled Costa Rican artisanal products to access a wider audience, allowing small businesses to compete more effectively against larger companies.&#xD;
&#xD;
Moreover, many small and medium-sized businesses have experienced substantial growth in sales due to the adoption of electronic payments. The ability to accept credit and debit cards has helped these businesses double or even triple their sales by attracting a broader customer base and simplifying the payment process through a new sales channel.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;This partnership between BCR and Evertec allows us to dream and envision beyond our current achievements. It brings new technologies and faster, safer, and simpler payment solutions to facilitate sales. In today&#x2019;s fast-paced business environment, having a commercial and strategic partner to keep pace with the market is essential. Evertec has been instrumental in supporting us on this journey of innovation and security, helping BCR and its customers grow&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Guillermo Gayle&#xD;
Gerente de Innovaci&#xF3;n y Medio de Pago, Banco de Costa Rica.&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Looking Ahead:&#xD;
Continuing Innovation and Expanding Impact&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;Our partnership with Banco de Costa Rica positions us as a strategic ally in their mission to innovate and lead the payment solutions sector in Costa Rica. It has enabled us to enhance their technological platform by implementing advanced solutions that meet market demands and customer needs. At Evertec, we are excited to continue collaborating with BCR to identify and develop products that facilitate access to electronic payment solutions and contribute to business growth in Costa Rica&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt; Juan Jos&#xE9; Abbiati&#xD;
Commercial Head NOLA de Evertec&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
This collaboration serves as a clear example of how strategic partnerships can drive business innovation and growth, especially in the highly competitive payment solutions sector. Thanks to Evertec&#x2019;s advanced technology and customer-centric approach, Banco de Costa Rica has maintained its position at the forefront of innovation, consistently prioritizing the security and satisfaction of its customers.</post_content><post_excerpt>&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.bancobcr.com/wps/portal/bcr" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Banco de Costa Rica  (BCR)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;), one of the cornerstones of state banking in Costa Rica, has undergone a transformation in recent years, focusing on technological innovation. This shift has been largely enabled by its strategic partnership with Evertec&#x2014;a collaboration that has empowered the bank to enhance its services and products, offering solutions that benefit thousands of customers, ranging from small businesses to large enterprises.</post_excerpt><post_date>2024-12-24 10:22:05</post_date><post_name>banco-de-costa-rica-and-evertec-driving-innovation-in-payment-solutions</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/BCR-innovacion-en-medios-de-pago.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>Banco de Costa Rica y Evertec: impulsando la innovaci&#xF3;n en medios de pago</translated_post_title><title>Banco de Costa Rica and Evertec: Driving Innovation in Payment Solutions</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Digital Transformation: How QualityIS Modernized its Business Management with Acumatica</post_title><ID>62682</ID><post_content>&lt;h2&gt;QualityIS Needed to&#xD;
Modernize Its Technology&#xD;
Infrastructure&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The Challenge:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
QualityIS faced several operational challenges due to an outdated ERP system that did not offer adequate solutions for retail or e-commerce, limiting the company&#x2019;s ability to integrate efficiently into an online sales environment. The online store operated independently, requiring manual import of orders and manual processes in the POS system. These challenges led QualityIS to seek a modern solution that could centralize and automate its operations.&#xD;
&#xD;
The motivation to change came after a recommendation from an existing client who had experienced a significant improvement in their operations thanks to Evertec&#x2019;s services. QualityIS needed to modernize its technology infrastructure to improve access to information and streamline business processes.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evertec Accelerates&#xD;
QualityIS&#x2019;s Success&#xD;
with Automatio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;n&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The solution:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
To address these issues, QualityIS implemented Acumatica, an advanced ERP system offered by Evertec. This solution allowed integration of the 1Retail POS and a connector to BigCommerce, providing a unified platform that automates and connects all operations. The implementation of Acumatica has facilitated process management, significantly reducing errors and accelerating decision-making. The implementation took place in 2022 and was completed in approximately four months. The success of the project was largely due to the continuous support from Evertec's implementation team, which worked closely with QualityIS throughout the process.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The result:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
The implementation of Acumatica significantly transformed QualityIS&#x2019;s operations. The automation of processes has led to greater efficiency and a substantial reduction in errors.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;Processing times have been drastically reduced, allowing tasks that previously took days to be completed with just the push of a button. This agility not only improves customer satisfaction but also frees up resources to focus on critical areas of the business, contributing to QualityIS&#x2019;s continued growth and success.&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Daniel Abarca,&#xD;
President QualityIS&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
For more information on how Acumatica can optimize your operations, visit &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="http://localhost/evertec/en/acumatica-erp/"&gt;www.evertecinc.com/en/acumatica-erp/&lt;/a&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>QualityIS (Quality Industrial Safety Corp.), founded in 1990, is a leading Puerto Rican company specializing in the sale and distribution of tools and BBQs. With a workforce of 24 employees and three stores&#x2014;two focused on tools and one on BBQs&#x2014;QualityIS has established itself as a leader in its sector. The company offers products from renowned brands like Milwaukee, Makita, Ridgid, and Klein, as well as a wide range of professional tools for technicians, plumbers, contractors, mechanics, electricians, and woodworkers, among others. QualityIS stands out in the market for its competitive prices and commitment to customer satisfaction.</post_excerpt><post_date>2025-01-27 20:29:10</post_date><post_name>digital-transformation-how-qualityis-modernized-its-business-management-with-acumatica</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/qualityis.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>Acumatica,ERP,Evertec,Puerto Rico,QualityIS</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>Transformaci&#xF3;n Digital: C&#xF3;mo QualityIS Moderniz&#xF3; su Gesti&#xF3;n Empresarial con Acumatica</translated_post_title><title>Digital Transformation: How QualityIS Modernized its Business Management with Acumatica</title><meta_desc>Acumatica transformed QualityIS, automating processes that have enabled greater efficiency and reduced errors</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Evertec became the perfect ally for QualityIS</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Three Years Later, PSD Corp. Continues to Fuel Its Growth with Acumatica ERP and Evertec</post_title><ID>62703</ID><post_content>&lt;h2&gt;The challenge:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
The relationship between PSD Corp. and Evertec began in 2020 when the company faced the need to modernize and centralize its operations to remain competitive in its industry. The main challenge was the lack of integration between its systems, which created silos and generated inefficiencies in its operation. The company was seeking a modern, scalable technological solution that would allow it to optimize processes, improve decision-making, and adapt to the growing demands of the market.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The solution:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
After evaluating PSD Corp.'s operations, Evertec recommended the implementation of Acumatica ERP, highlighting its ease of use, flexibility, and ability to integrate with third-party applications. Additionally, Acumatica would allow the company to incorporate mobile tools, enabling its field staff to use portable devices on customer sites.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Implementation:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
The Evertec team successfully completed the Acumatica implementation in 3 months, in April 2021. The team evaluated all of the company's processes, identifying challenges and opportunities within its operations. Open and honest communication between both teams helped establish a strong relationship, allowing PSD Corp. to be fully prepared and confident before, during, and after the implementation. This support has continued since the implementation and has been essential in optimizing our systems and processes.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;A key factor for the success of the implementation was the commitment and experience of the Evertec team.&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The result:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
The implementation of Acumatica ERP has brought significant improvements to PSD Corp.'s operations, accelerating many processes that were previously manual. Three years after the implementation, N&#xE9;stor D&#xE1;vila, President of PSD Corp., shares in this video how Acumatica ERP has transformed the way the company operates.&#xD;
&#xD;
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P3DnikjlmF0&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;We have automated processes and centralized data in a way that has completely transformed our operations. With Evertec&#x2019;s support, we continue to modernize and improve our business, which has significantly helped the growth we are experiencing.&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;N&#xE9;stor D. D&#xE1;vila,&#xD;
President PSD Corp.&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
Thanks to its collaboration with Evertec, PSD Corp. has achieved full digitalization of its operations. Acumatica ERP has allowed the company to successfully adapt to the growing demands of the market and has fueled its growth, flexibility, and progress.&#xD;
&#xD;
To learn more about Acumatica, visit &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="http://localhost/evertec/en/acumatica-erp/"&gt;www.evertecinc.com/en/acumatica-erp/&lt;/a&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>PSD Corp. (Professional Sealing Devices, Corp.) is a Puerto Rican company founded in 2001 by N&#xE9;stor D. D&#xE1;vila, headquartered in San Juan, Puerto Rico. PSD Corp. employs a team of 16 people and specializes in products and services related to fluid handling and transfer. The company offers a wide range of solutions, including consulting, parts and equipment supply, engineering, maintenance, and repair of various industrial devices such as pumps, valves, mechanical seals, transmissions, rotating equipment, and tanks. Its commitment to quality, innovation, and customer service has positioned PSD Corp. as a leader in the industrial solutions market in Puerto Rico.</post_excerpt><post_date>2025-01-27 20:44:45</post_date><post_name>three-years-later-psd-corp-continues-to-fuel-its-growth-with-acumatica-erp-and-evertec</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/PSD-Corp.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>Acumatica,ERP,Evertec,PSD Corp.,Puerto Rico</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>A 3 a&#xF1;os, PSD Corp. sigue potenciando su crecimiento con Acumatica ERP y Evertec</translated_post_title><title>Three Years Later, PSD Corp. Continues to Fuel Its Growth with Acumatica ERP and Evertec</title><meta_desc>The implementation of Acumatica ERP has improvements to PSD Corp.&#x2019;s operations, accelerating many processes that were previously manual.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Evertec became the perfect partner for PSD Corp.</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Mercado Libre and Evertec Transform Card Issuance in Latin America</post_title><ID>62737</ID><post_content>&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mercado Libre&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;As the leading e-commerce platform in Latin America, Mercado Libre recognized the need for a technology partner to support its card issuance strategy across multiple markets, including credit, debit, and prepaid cards. The partnership initially started in Mexico and later expanded to Chile. Thanks to its recognized expertise and technological capabilities, Evertec emerged as the ideal ally for this endeavor. Together, they implemented advanced systems that adhered to stringent security and efficiency standards while maintaining the necessary agility to adapt to market dynamics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pioneering &lt;br /&gt;Card Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;In 2019, Mercado Libre began its ambitious venture into the card market, selecting Evertec as its strategic partner to facilitate the launch. This collaboration led to the successful introduction of a Mastercard-branded, fully digital debit card in 2020. A standout innovation was the QR code-based activation system.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Following the success in Mexico and with support from Evertec's specialized team, Mercado Libre expanded into Chile's prepaid card market the following year. This product, linked to a digital account, quickly gained popularity and earned recognition from Chile's Financial Market Commission (CMF) as the leading non-bank issuer of payment solutions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Building on the success of its debit card in Mexico, Mercado Libre launched a credit card in collaboration with Visa as part of its second phase.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;The Regional Challenge: &lt;br /&gt;Scaling Payment Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;The success of debit cards in Mexico has allowed Mercado Libre to address the complexities of launching regional payment products. Expanding into the prepaid card market in Chile required adapting to diverse market dynamics and local regulatory requirements. With Evertec's expertise, this regional rollout was executed seamlessly, ensuring compliance and effectively addressing local needs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A significant challenge was continuously refining the technological platform to provide optimal user experiences and facilitate efficient transactions. Evertec tackled this by making ongoing adjustments and optimizations, ensuring the platform evolved in response to market demands. Strong communication between the two companies was crucial in meeting client needs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The launch of credit cards in 2022 added another layer of complexity, necessitating Evertec's integration of advanced systems for processing, back-office operations, and credit core management. Supported by PayStudio, Evertec delivered the project on time, ensuring the system's full functionality.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Collaboration with Visa was also essential for the credit card launch. Evertec played a key role in facilitating this strategic partnership, which enhanced Mercado Libre's financial product offerings and reinforced its position in the regional market. The successful launch in Mexico marked a significant milestone in Mercado Libre's expansion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Early Results: &lt;br /&gt;Debit Card Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;The combined efforts of both teams have led to remarkable success for the debit card in Mexico. Mercado Libre has issued over 8 million debit cards, which manage an average of 10 million monthly transactions. This substantial volume reflects the market's confidence in the efficiency of the services and solutions provided.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Credit Card Impact&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since its launch, the credit card service has experienced significant growth, with over 1.7 million accounts and more than 3 million cards issued. These cards have facilitated over 8.4 million transactions, highlighting Evertec's effectiveness in managing financial services.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prepaid Card &lt;br /&gt;Success in Chile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;In Chile, the introduction of prepaid cards has also been successful, with more than 1.1 million cards issued since their launch in 2022. These cards process over 2 million transactions monthly, showcasing Evertec's ability to meet market demands with innovative and efficient payment solutions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Model for Future Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;This success story highlights the transformative impact of fintech in Latin America, establishing a foundation for future collaborations and advancements within the sector. The ongoing innovation and adaptability of Evertec and Mercado Libre have solidified their leadership roles in the electronic payment revolution and in promoting financial inclusion throughout the region.&lt;/p&gt;		
					&lt;blockquote&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;
				Mercado Libre challenged us to push our limits at every turn. In their fast-paced environment, speed of response is crucial. This client embraces a high level of risk and continually questions the status quo. We rose to the challenge, delivering agility and efficiency in meeting their demands.			&lt;/p&gt;
											&lt;cite&gt;Juan Abbiati&lt;br&gt;Commercial Head of NOLA.&lt;/cite&gt;
					&lt;/blockquote&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Latin America's financial technology landscape constantly evolves, presenting both opportunities and challenges. In response to this dynamic environment, a strategic alliance between Evertec and Mercado Libre has emerged as a hub of innovation and efficiency. Since its establishment in 2019, this collaboration has introduced advanced technological solutions for issuing and processing digital payments. It has significantly transformed electronic payment transactions through key projects launched in Mexico and Chile.</post_excerpt><post_date>2024-09-10 21:31:20</post_date><post_name>mercado-libre-and-evertec-transform-card-issuance-in-latin-america</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/MercadoLibre.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>emisi&#xF3;n de tarjetas,Evertec,mercado libre,tarjetas</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>Mercado Libre junto a Evertec transforman la emisi&#xF3;n de tarjetas en Am&#xE9;rica Latina</translated_post_title><title>Mercado Libre and Evertec Transform Card Issuance in Latin America</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>alianza estrat&#xE9;gica entre Evertec y Mercado Libre</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec and Grupo Santander: Transforming Financial Experience in Latin America</post_title><ID>62743</ID><post_content>&lt;h2&gt;Grupo Santander&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since entering Chile in 1978, Banco Santander Chile has become a leading financial institution. With 259 branches and over four million customers, the bank is recognized for its strong economic performance and profitability. Banco Santander Chile also caters to more than two million digital customers, demonstrating its commitment to innovation and service excellence. The bank's success is rooted in a strategy focused on financial specialization, effective risk management, and active market participation, all supported by Grupo Santander's extensive international network.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The partnership between Evertec and Grupo Santander began in 1996 with the implementation of the Automated Clearing Center (CCA), which enabled electronic payments between banks and set the foundation for mass payment processing and electronic funds transfers (EFT). Over the years, Evertec has played a pivotal role in developing advanced technological solutions that have diversified and improved the financial services Grupo Santander offers in the region. This collaboration has reinforced Evertec's position as a leader in the financial industry, showcasing its ability to adapt to and meet the evolving demands of the fintech market.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Technological &lt;br /&gt;and Security Challenges&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;From the beginning, the partnership between Evertec and Grupo Santander has encountered significant technical challenges, particularly in technology and security. The rapid increase in digital financial transactions has necessitated solutions that ensure agility, efficiency, and security. In response, Evertec has introduced several innovations, such as the REI system for ATM management, electronic pension payment solutions, and multi-bank debit models. These initiatives have enhanced Grupo Santander's customer experience and established both companies as leaders in the digital transformation of the region's financial sector.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In 2020, Getnet achieved notable milestones. It established the Santander Getnet Chile S.A. Payment Card Operator in May and launched a pilot program in September. Throughout the year, Getnet received authorization from the Comisi&#xF3;n para el Mercado Financiero (CMF) to operate in January and began commercializing its services in February. Despite challenges posed by the pandemic, by March, the company had onboarded 10,000 merchants. By September, the number of point-of-sale (POS) terminals sold had reached 41,000, distributed across more than 30,000 merchants nationwide. By October, Getnet had 37,000 clients, and by the end of the year, it had acquired over 68,000 merchants, generating 3 billion CLP in commission revenues.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The company initially projected onboarding 20,000 merchants by 2021 but far exceeded this goal. "Our target for 2021 was to reach 25,000 merchants, but we surpassed 56,000," stated Cristi&#xE1;n Peirano Novoa, Getnet's president in 2021. Today, the company operates in 99% of the national territory, including Easter Island and the Juan Fern&#xE1;ndez archipelago&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Grupo Santander &lt;br /&gt;Stands Out in the Market&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;The entrance of a new acquirer into the market created fresh opportunities for Grupo Santander, spurring national economic growth and enhancing Evertec's presence in the region. With Evertec's robust technological solutions, Grupo Santander quickly established itself by offering high-quality payment processing services. This attracted over 4,000 large companies for card payment processing and connected over 50,000 merchants within the first year, 93% of them being SMEs, entrepreneurs, and local businesses. That same year, Getnet expanded its reach to cover 97% of Chilean municipalities, providing nationwide access to innovative financial services.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In 2023, an agreement was made to implement solutions for managing over 2,000 Banco Santander ATMs in Chile. This further solidified both companies' operational efficiency and presence in the region, reaffirming their commitment to continuous innovation and excellence in financial services.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Evertec and Grupo Santander remain focused on innovation and the constant improvement of their services. Their ability to quickly adapt to market demands and anticipate emerging challenges will be crucial in maintaining their leadership in the fintech sector. This strategic collaboration has fostered economic and social growth in Latin America, paved the way for new opportunities, and expanded their influence in the regional financial landscape.&lt;/p&gt;		
