			&lt;p&gt;
				This achievement has been made possible thanks to Grupo Santander's long-standing trust in Evertec. It is also due to the expertise of our team members, their specialized knowledge, and, fundamentally, their attitude and dedication, which provide us with a significant differentiating factor.			&lt;/p&gt;
											&lt;cite&gt; Rodrigo Del Castillo, &lt;br&gt;Chief Commercial Officer of Evertec.&lt;/cite&gt;
					&lt;/blockquote&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;The strategic collaboration between Evertec and Grupo Santander has led to significant milestones that have marked a turning point in the financial industry in Latin America. In 2013, the implementation of the collections hub system for Santander Consumer significantly optimized collection processes. In 2021, one of the most notable achievements was the successful market launch of acquiring services through Getnet. Working hand in hand, Evertec and Grupo Santander challenged the existing ecosystem and diversified the payment processing market in Chile, offering innovative solutions that transformed the financial industry.&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Financial technology is crucial in driving economic and social progress in today's globalized world. Evertec and Grupo Santander have formed a strategic partnership that has reshaped the financial landscape in Latin America for over 25 years. Since their collaboration began in 1996, they have introduced innovations that have greatly improved the efficiency and security of payment processing, electronic transactions, and ATM management.</post_excerpt><post_date>2024-04-12 16:11:04</post_date><post_name>evertec-and-grupo-santander-transforming-financial-experience-in-latin-america</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/getnet.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>Evertec Chile,Getnet,Grupo Santander</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>Evertec y Grupo Santander transforman la experiencia financiera en Am&#xE9;rica Latina</translated_post_title><title>Evertec and Grupo Santander: Transforming Financial Experience in Latin America</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Coopemep offers its customers the largest QR payment network in Costa Rica with the support of Evertec&#xAE;</post_title><ID>62835</ID><post_content>Coopemep has established itself as a financial institution committed to the economic well-being of its members and the Costa Rican community. Throughout its history, it has provided quality financial solutions that adapt to the changing needs of the market.&#xD;
&#xD;
In alignment with its mission to offer comprehensive and innovative financial services, Coopemep has implemented &lt;a href="http://localhost/evertec/en/evertec-expands-digital-payment-network-with-acquisition-of-zunify-costa-rica/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Zunify&lt;/a&gt;, an Evertec solution that centralizes the management of bank accounts in a single application. This tool allows users to make payments through QR codes in dataphones, e-commerce platforms and remote transfers through the Notify functionality, while offering them a number of benefits at merchants associated with the platform.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&#x201C;Coopemep's implementation of Zunify is a clear reflection of its dedication to innovation and continuous improvement of services for its associates. At Evertec, we are honored to be the technology partner that accompanies Coopemep in this step towards digitalization, offering solutions that provide security, efficiency and convenience to end users&#x201D;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Jimmy Solano Blanco,&#xD;
Country Manager of Central America for Evertec&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
We congratulate Coopemep for their dedication to continue strengthening their offering, and we look forward to continuing accompanying them in projects that drive the digital transformation and development of the cooperative sector in Costa Rica.</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2025-02-07 11:01:49</post_date><post_name>coopemep-offers-its-customers-the-largest-qr-payment-network-in-costa-rica-with-the-support-of-evertec</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/coopemep.webp</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>Coopemep,Costa Rica,Evertec,Zunify</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>Coopemep pone a disposici&#xF3;n de sus clientes la red de pagos QR m&#xE1;s grande de Costa Rica con el apoyo de Evertec&#xAE;</translated_post_title><title>Coopemep launches the largest QR payment network in Costa Rica</title><meta_desc>Coopemep has established itself as a financial institution committed to the economic well-being of its members.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Coopemep has implemented Zunify</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Coocique continues its commitment to the digitalization of payments after implementing Zunify from Evertec&#xAE;</post_title><ID>62881</ID><post_content>With more than 60 years of history, &lt;a href="https://coocique.fi.cr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Coocique&lt;/a&gt; has stood out as a savings and credit cooperative that prioritizes the well-being of its members, families and communities through productive projects, social programs and a strong commitment to sustainability. The cooperative has demonstrated its leadership by facilitating innovative and accessible financial solutions, contributing to social and economic progress in Costa Rica.&#xD;
&#xD;
The recent implementation of Zunify, Evertec's QR payment network that unifies the financial system in a single application, marks a new milestone in its &lt;a href="/en/processing/"&gt;digital evolution&lt;/a&gt;. This solution allows customers to centralize the management of their debit accounts, make payments with QR codes, accumulate cashback, apply discounts and promotions at affiliated merchants and make remote transfers through the Notify functionality. It also reinforces Coocique's commitment to sustainability and financial innovation.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;"The implementation of Zunify in Coocique represents a significant step forward in the digital transformation of the cooperative financial sector in Costa Rica. We are proud to collaborate with an organization that shares our vision of offering technological solutions that improve the payment experience and support the digitalization of payments. This project reaffirms our dedication to continue being strategic allies of our clients on their path to innovation.&#x201D;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Jimmy Solano Blanco,&#xD;
Country Manager de Centroam&#xE9;rica para Evertec&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
We congratulate Coocique for this great achievement and for continuing to implement initiatives that transform the experience of its members and strengthen its position in the financial market.</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2025-02-10 16:39:18</post_date><post_name>coocique-continues-its-commitment-to-the-digitalization-of-payments-after-implementing-zunify-from-evertec</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Coocique-Zunify.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>cashback,Coocique,Costa Rica,descuento,Evertec,Notify,promoci&#xF3;n,Pagos QR,Transferencia,Zunify</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>Coocique sigue apostando por la digitalizaci&#xF3;n de los pagos tras implementar Zunify de Evertec&#xAE;</translated_post_title><title>%%title%% %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>This solution allows you to manage debit accounts, QR payments, accumulate cashback, apply discounts and promotions, and make transfers.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Coocique implements Evertec's Zunify</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Coocique offers its cardholders more secure transactions with the support of Evertec&#xAE;</post_title><ID>62894</ID><post_content>With more than 10 years of business relationship, &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://coocique.fi.cr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Coocique&lt;/a&gt; and Evertec have worked together to drive innovative financial solutions that protect and enhance the cardholder experience. With the recent implementation of &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/en/3dsecure-protocol/"&gt;EMV 3DS ACS (Access Control Server)&lt;/a&gt;, Coocique is taking another step to strengthen the security of online transactions.&#xD;
&#xD;
This security protocol verifies the identity of the cardholder during the online purchase. Upon receiving the authentication request, the system analyzes various parameters such as transaction profile, geolocation and device information to assess the level of risk and thus request additional authentication when necessary to ensure that the transaction is made by the legitimate card owner.&#xD;
&#xD;
By authenticating the user's identity in real time, Coocique not only protects its customers against fraud, but also significantly reduces chargebacks, offering peace of mind and confidence to its cardholders when making online purchases.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;"The implementation of EMV 3DS ACS reaffirms Coocique's commitment to secure online transactions and protect its customers from the challenges of online commerce. This milestone reflects our shared mission to provide reliable, cutting-edge technology to strengthen the digital payments ecosystem in Costa Rica."&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Jimmy Solano Blanco,&#xD;
Country Manager of Central America for Evertec&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
We congratulate Coocique for maintaining its focus on the security and well-being of its customers!</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2025-04-08 16:23:45</post_date><post_name>coocique-offers-its-cardholders-more-secure-transactions-with-the-support-of-evertec</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Coocique-3DS.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>3DS,cashback,Coocique,Costa Rica,descuento,Evertec,Notify,promoci&#xF3;n,Pagos QR,seguridad,Transferencia,Zunify</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>Coocique ofrece a sus tarjetahabientes transacciones m&#xE1;s seguras con el apoyo de Evertec&#xAE;</translated_post_title><title>%%title%% %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>3DS security protocol verifies cardholder identity during online purchase</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Coocique implements Evertec's 3DS</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>FinanCard launches its new digital wallet linked to a prepaid Mastercard processed by Evertec</post_title><ID>64360</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;Seeking to expand access to financial services in Panama, Financiera FinanCard has launched EASI by Financard, a digital wallet associated with a prepaid Mastercard processed by Evertec. This innovative tool allows users to easily reload funds, make purchases at physical and online merchants, make recurring charges and transfer money instantly to other users within the application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This launch not only expands Financiera FinanCard's offering, but also boosts financial inclusion by offering an accessible and modern alternative for the unbanked population by facilitating secure, real-time transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
					&lt;blockquote&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;
				&#x201C;Financiera FinanCard's vision in implementing EASI by Financard is a significant step towards financial inclusion in Panama. At Evertec, we are proud to be the technology partner supporting this initiative, facilitating the acceptance of wallets and payment methods that make transactions easier, safer and more efficient. This project reflects our shared commitment to transform the payments ecosystem in Panama.&#x201D;			&lt;/p&gt;
											&lt;cite&gt;Jimmy Solano Blanco,&lt;br&gt;Country Manager de Centroam&#xE9;rica para Evertec&lt;/cite&gt;
					&lt;/blockquote&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;We congratulate Financiera FinanCard on this important milestone and reaffirm our commitment to continue promoting the digitalization and modernization of the financial system in Panama and the region.&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2025-04-08 17:24:00</post_date><post_name>financard-launches-its-new-digital-wallet-linked-to-a-prepaid-mastercard-processed-by-evertec</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/easi-financard.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>recargas digitales,billetera digital Panam&#xE1;,EASI by Financard,Evertec,FinanCard Evertec,inclusi&#xF3;n financiera Panam&#xE1;,modernizaci&#xF3;n financiera,fintech Panam&#xE1;,transferencias instant&#xE1;neas,Pagos digitales,tarjeta prepago Mastercard</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options/><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>FinanCard lanza su nueva billetera digital asociada a una tarjeta prepago Mastercard procesada por Evertec</translated_post_title><title>New EASI Digital Wallet Panama %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>FinanCard launches EASI, its digital wallet with Mastercard and Evertec, driving financial inclusion and digital payments in Panama.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>digital wallet EASI by Financard</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Clic Air: Taking off towards efficiency and security in your payments with Evertec</post_title><ID>65296</ID><post_content>&lt;h2&gt;The challenge&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clic Air needed a robust and flexible payment solution that would allow them to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve the online shopping experience:&lt;/strong&gt; offering their passengers an intuitive and secure payment platform to purchase their tickets quickly and easily.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversify payment options:&lt;/strong&gt; to adapt to their customers' preferences and increase purchasing possibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen transaction security:&lt;/strong&gt; minimizing the risk of fraud and protecting sensitive information of its passengers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The solution&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clic Air found in Evertec Placetopay the perfect ally to optimize its online payment system. By integrating Web Checkout, Payment Link, 3DS and Scudo solutions, the airline achieved:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplify the checkout process:&lt;/strong&gt; Web Checkout provided a user-friendly and responsive interface, making it easy to purchase tickets from any device.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offer multiple payment options:&lt;/strong&gt; passengers can choose their preferred payment method, including Click to pay, the payment method offered by the brands, increasing flexibility and convenience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Increase security:&lt;/strong&gt; 3DS and Scudo provide an additional layer of protection against fraud, authenticating transactions and minimizing risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate customized payment links:&lt;/strong&gt; with Payment Link, Clic Air can create customized offers and promotions for its customers, optimizing their marketing strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The result&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The implementation of Evertec Placetopay solutions has boosted efficiency and security in Clic Air's operations:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Increased sales conversion:&lt;/strong&gt; an optimized shopping experience translates into increased online ticket sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reduced fraud and increased transaction security.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improved passenger experience:&lt;/strong&gt; A simpler, faster and more secure purchase process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Increased operational efficiency and reduced costs.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
					&lt;blockquote&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;
				By integrating Evertec Placetopay solutions, Clic Air has taken an important step in its digital transformation, consolidating itself as a leading airline in innovation and customer service.&#x201D; Isaac Herrera, Director Product and Sales.&#x201D;			&lt;/p&gt;
					&lt;/blockquote&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Clic Air, a pioneering regional airline in Colombia connecting intermediate cities since 2007, has established itself as a key player in the country's air transportation. With a focus on efficiency and customer satisfaction, Clic Air has constantly sought to optimize its operations, including the management of its online payments.</post_excerpt><post_date>2025-06-12 17:55:04</post_date><post_name>clic-air-taking-off-towards-efficiency-and-security-in-your-payments-with-evertec</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Clic-Air.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>recargas digitales,billetera digital Panam&#xE1;,EASI by Financard,Evertec,FinanCard Evertec,inclusi&#xF3;n financiera Panam&#xE1;,modernizaci&#xF3;n financiera,fintech Panam&#xE1;,transferencias instant&#xE1;neas,Pagos digitales,tarjeta prepago Mastercard</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options/><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><language_code>en</language_code><translated_post_title>Clic Air: Despegando hacia la eficiencia y seguridad en sus pagos con Evertec</translated_post_title><title>Secure and Efficient Payments at Clic Air %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>Clic Air enhances digital payments with Evertec, improving security, purchase options, and passenger experience across Colombia.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>digital payment solutions for airlines</f